    "rubbing-in"
  ],
  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sourdough discard scones use unfed starter in place of some of the buttermilk, giving a mild tang and a slightly open crumb. They mix and bake in under 30 minutes with no special equipment. The discard must be at room temperature before you start, or the cold liquid will seize the butter."
          }
        ]
      },
